#
# # Migration note for any existing user code
#
# Mechanical rename. A `sed` pass covers the public attrs:
#
# ```
# sed -i 's/#\[rustc_cxx_ctor\]/#[constructor]/g;
#         s/#\[rustc_cxx_virtual\]/#[cpp_virtual]/g;
#         s/#\[rustc_cxx_operator/\#[operator/g;
#         s/#\[rustc_swift_type/\#[swift_type/g;
#         s/#\[rustc_swift_symbol/\#[swift_symbol/g;
#         s/cxx_class_native!/native_cpp_class!/g' FILE
# ```
#
# No semantic changes — same AttributeKind variants, same codegen.
